ches or bugs. \n|\n- - Am i able to get moderator?\n- **No. And they are not called moderator in this game for some odd reason.**\n\n- - Will The Game Get More Updates In The Future?\n- **Yes. But they will not be all day.**\n\n|\n- - Will The Game Get Horror Mode?\n- **Yes. It will come out later until we get ideas from it.**", "short_description": "Runners Is On Alpha"}]}, "developer_name": "Cookie Studios", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/blocky-paradox-privacy-policy/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Mono", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/blockyarcadewebsite/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1023770785722696"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "25907322942189146"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499308281_1408132950485005_1031009037313158924_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_cGCbrvlu3AQ7kNvwGn67R0&_nc_oc=AdqNXUAHP9Hv-8G3GJ_3TYaUrlzzDrzhvWE6yJpEBEBZ7HkmAaqTz-VxOP9GsFQ8JM8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4xn4ZPCcVaEQrWiFmrWBg0G704KweisA6ChwFv2PrtRw&oe=6A11BBCD"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Runners", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "c